{"id":"ccbc15:problem:4-27","answer":"RAW FILLET","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"该如何提取","html":"<p>把每行的标注区域分别相加后转为字母</p>","text":"把每行的标注区域分别相加后转为字母","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"我解不开这个数独，能简化一下吗","html":"<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-4c469f3ef3d9c979e2315d05\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc15/images/4/186d2b1c0a144a0e86194bcf52c0ef2b.webp\" width=\"300\"/></p>\n<p>在线解题链接（无答案验证）：<a href=\"https://puzz.cipherpuzzles.com/penpa-edit/?m=solve&amp;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">penpa+</a> <a href=\"https://sudokupad.app/1y8sc36x68\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">sudokupad(与题面sudokupad互通)</a></p>","text":"在线解题链接（无答案验证）：\npenpa+\n\nsudokupad(与题面sudokupad互通)","assetIds":["asset-4c469f3ef3d9c979e2315d05"]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>解摩天楼和数独的复合纸笔，求每行标蓝的数字之和，a1z26转换为字母，得到答案<strong>RAW FILLET</strong></p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-dda583f1db81ed464495307e\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc15/images/4/dc2b066771054d6fad875a1b584feeb1.webp\" width=\"500\"/></p>","text":"解摩天楼和数独的复合纸笔，求每行标蓝的数字之和，a1z26转换为字母，得到答案\nRAW FILLET","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-dda583f1db81ed464495307e"]},"extended":{"html":"<p>你要离开之前，获得了一份旅游指南，你注意到其中一句话被圈了出来：“这座城市有着许多森林，草原，以及最独特的物种多样性。”</p>","text":"你要离开之前，获得了一份旅游指南，你注意到其中一句话被圈了出来：“这座城市有着许多森林，草原，以及最独特的物种多样性。”","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{},"sourceMetadata":{"type":"problem","content-type":1},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-4c469f3ef3d9c979e2315d05","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc15/images/4/186d2b1c0a144a0e86194bcf52c0ef2b.webp","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc15/images/4/186d2b1c0a144a0e86194bcf52c0ef2b.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":455754,"sha256":"62ae08897fb8c796e42402985b9d73677d15de70d9f66bdf4981042b970417ce","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["hint:2"]},{"id":"asset-dda583f1db81ed464495307e","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc15/images/4/dc2b066771054d6fad875a1b584feeb1.